message: "If you use Cupcake Bench or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Cupcake Bench"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Cupcake Bench authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ruyari-cupcake/cupcake-bench-public"
url: "https://github.com/ruyari-cupcake/cupcake-bench-public"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
